# Frontend build inputs: never copy host node_modules, a baked dist or a local
# .env into any layer. Plain `dist`/`.env` match the repo root only, so the
# `**/` forms are required to also cover `webui/` (COPY webui/ in webui/Dockerfile).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
# TLS material is a deployment secret - must never enter any image build context.
certs
certs.saved
# Local reference material (~563 MB): irrelevant to every image, would bloat every build context.
example-projects
_scratch_reference
# Internal process notes; never needed to build any image.
docs/internal
